{"id":"50f8cec2add25f5b","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-lowforml.md","title":"Martin–Löf 随机低性","display":"df-lowforml — Martin–Löf 随机低性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-lowforml","aliases":["43-df-lowforml"],"display":"df-lowforml — Martin–Löf 随机低性","depends_on":["[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Def.15.1.17, printed p.414 / PDF p.434","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-lowforml"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-lowforml</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lowforml — Martin–Löf 随机低性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Def.15.1.17, printed p.414 / PDF p.434"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForML}(A)\\iff\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\,[\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A(X)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LowForML}(A)\\iff\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\,[\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A(X)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>相对随机蕴含非相对随机自动成立，因此单向保持式与两个随机类相等一致；修复原 oracle 来源链。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-rel-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"75e7e3b6eeecc95e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-rel-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"75e7e3b6eeecc95e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LowForML}(A)\\iff\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\,[\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A(X)].","display":true}],"bytes":1063,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-349","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-lowforml]] — Martin–Löf 随机低性"},{"id":"d6ed80ff71a4c469","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{LowForML}$ 与 $\\mathrm{KTrivial}$ 见 [[43-df-lowforml]]、[[43-df-ktrivial]]。"},{"id":"891bf326beb513ee","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；相关定义见 [[43-df-lowfortest]]、[[43-df-lowforml]]；固定通用相对测试及非相对测试见 [[43-thm-ml-universal-test]]。"},{"id":"6bc0e10245f83988","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；三个谓词见 [[43-df-ktrivial]]、[[43-df-lowfork]]、[[43-df-lowforml]]。"}],"outgoing":["0586e0fd0301d605","75e7e3b6eeecc95e"]}